## Data Lineage

### Stops — Position (Tier D — OSM)

All stop coordinates sourced from OpenStreetMap. OSM coverage for Mumbai Metro is
good for Lines 1, 2A, 7 elevated. Line 3 underground coverage is improving.

**To re-extract from OSM:**
```
npx ts-node tdse/extraction/osm.ts --city mumbai --relation 7076048
```

### Stops — Names (Tier B — Operator Official)

Station names verified against:
- MMOPL: `https://www.mumbai-metro.com` (Line 1)
- MMMOCL: `https://www.mmmocl.co.in` (Lines 2A, 7)
- MMRC: `https://mmrcl.com` (Line 3)

### Services / Schedules (Tier E / X1 — Synthesized)

No official timetables published by any Mumbai Metro operator as of Oct 2026.
Headways derived from:
- Press releases citing "3-minute peak headways" (MMOPL, MMMOCL)
- MMRC operational announcements
- Comparison with similar Indian metro systems (Hyderabad, Pune)

**Marked X1 — Headway Estimate. Confidence 0.55–0.65.**

### Fares (Tier B — Line 1 | Tier E — Lines 2A, 7, 3)

- Line 1 fare slabs published by MMOPL on official website
- Lines 2A, 7, 3 fares: estimated / not in CTM v0.1.0

### Transfers (Tier D/E — OSM + Estimated)

Transfer times at D.N. Nagar, Dahisar East, Andheri estimated from:
- OSM station geometry (walking distance)
- Typical Indian metro transfer walk speed (50 m/min)
- Marked X4 — Transfer Time Estimated

